{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Behold, a witness.</b> This is the Messiah." "<b>Leader and commander of nations, root.</b> And it is possible that the reason is, for the explanation [is] that the Messiah is a witness, for there is no other king prince over the world." "<b>And commander.</b> Who commands whatever he commands <small>(they shall do)</small>."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 55, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:36.997095155Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}